{"version":1,"key":"card:77","content":{"id":77,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6150b126-763a-4669-9e14-766b9c9a78f7","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"rm"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 用来删除文件和文件夹"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"f64b5d68-706b-4559-b521-7804aecdd03c","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"bc0c1baa-fc4e-419b-a0de-4a9b3a4a3ae0","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"~ » tree\n.\n├── dst\n│   ├── hello.c\n│   ├── hello.md\n│   └── hello2.md\n└── src\n\n2 directories, 3 files\n# 删除 dst 下的 hello2.md\n~ » rm dst/hello2.md\n~ » tree\n.\n├── dst\n│   ├── hello.c\n│   └── hello.md\n└── src\n\n2 directories, 2 files","collabId":"31f72aea-449e-454e-bae7-69a1325f033a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0c68454d-f326-4778-bf83-0c6975cb808f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Linux"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 没有回收站，所以删除操作是一个很危险的操作，我们可以为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"rm"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令添加 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-i"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项，它会在删除文件之前进行询问"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"e24eb719-9df8-4d90-b249-91f78c63e10e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e042823c-172e-4961-90a8-7cafeea855c6","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"~ » rm -i dst/hello.md\nrm: remove regular empty file 'dst/hello.md'? y\n~ » tree\n.\n├── dst\n│   └── hello.c\n└── src\n\n2 directories, 1 file","collabId":"8906aec1-56b5-48b6-b353-11eaf7f73433","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"369505ad-f5bb-4e1c-b934-aeada48caf55","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们删除不存在的文件时，会给出错误提示该文件不存在"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"03eab14b-e6df-4d21-8a77-19b61ce4e68c","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"54bdd661-7a7b-40c5-aca1-3b758ec0862b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"~ » rm dst/hello.md\nrm: cannot remove 'dst/hello.md': No such file or directory","collabId":"0b504da4-a3e6-4131-a6d2-510a05cd0086","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0f80de9d-d8e0-4d12-840c-f4be2b00d22c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"此时我们可以添加 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-f"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-f"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示强制删除，不管其存在与否，当添加该选项以后，就不会显示任何的提示信息，即使该文件不存在，或者添加了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-i"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项，都不会有任何的提示信息"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"d218748b-122a-42d9-95de-a14037293a7b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1b55160a-02cf-4ad0-92fc-ce40c3521a08","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 即使文件不存在也不会有任何的提示信息\n~ » rm -f dst/hello.md\n# 即使有 -i 选项，但是因为添加了 -f 选项后也不会询问\n~ » rm -if dst/hello.c\n~ » tree\n.\n├── dst\n└── src\n\n2 directories, 0 files","collabId":"81fa0254-f5cc-41aa-b95d-6aaa55b6ae75","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"193055fb-65ef-414b-a7ef-aeff35843616","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"rm"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 除了可以删除文件外，还可以删除文件夹，不过不能直接删除文件夹，需要添加 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-r"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-r"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项表示递归删除的意思，添加该选项后可以删除文件夹下的所有内容(包括该文件夹)"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"2ba2458e-af70-4e28-b830-64e684ab0f56","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6d768a7e-c48c-44ea-b0ed-c4cb6f515c1d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 直接删除，删除失败\n~ » rm src\nrm: cannot remove 'src': Is a directory\n# 添加 -r 选项，删除成功\n~ » rm -r src\n~ » tree\n.\n└── dst\n\n1 directory, 0 files","collabId":"0c0ef156-ce2c-4989-8eff-dfb040d723fc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["Linux/命令/rm"],"createTime":1689167841513,"updateTime":1745155330428,"linkedCards":[{"id":78,"target":{"key":"card:78","type":"card","id":78},"summary":"使用 rmdir 可以删除一个空文件夹 ~ » rmdir dir ~ » tree . ├── d1 │ └── d2 │ └── d3 └── dir1 └── dir2 └── dir3 6 directories, 0 files ...","tags":["Linux/命令/rmdir"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1745155330428}}